# 2. Incident Lifecycle

The basic incident lifecycle is:

```text
Detect
  ↓
Assess
  ↓
Respond
  ↓
Mitigate
  ↓
Recover
  ↓
Investigate
  ↓
Learn
  ↓
Prevent recurrence
```

A more detailed SRE flow:

```text
Detect incident
      ↓
Declare incident
      ↓
Assess impact & severity
      ↓
Assign / establish roles
      ↓
Coordinate response
      ↓
Communicate
      ↓
Mitigate
      ↓
Restore service
      ↓
Investigate root cause
      ↓
Blameless postmortem
      ↓
Corrective / preventive actions
      ↓
Validate changes
      ↓
Deploy safely
      ↓
Monitor
      ↓
Close incident + track remaining actions
```

